<title>UK: TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DFS CLASSIC WOMEN'S GRASS-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the DFS Classic women's grass-court tennis tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) 6-4 6-4</p>
